# Upstream commits taken inside the ADR 0001 boundary ahead of an upstream release.
#
# Each line is a full 40-character sha reachable from upstream/main, and the frozen
# packages must equal `.upstream-tag` plus these commits' own diffs, restricted to
# frozen paths. Nothing here is hand-written: the diff is read from upstream's history
# when the gate runs.
#
# A line earns its place only when upstream has already fixed something that breaks
# this repository and no tag carries the fix yet. Delete it at the next upstream merge
# -- the gate fails when the baseline already contains a listed commit, so a stale
# entry reports itself rather than lingering.
